// ==UserScript==
// @name         GeoFS FMC
// @namespace    GeoFS-FMC
// @version      1.2
// @description  Boeing 737-style FMC/CDU. Button docks into the GeoFS bottom bar (next to MCP PANEL). Colours change with the aircraft. Picks up a flight plan loaded in GeoFS and draws the route on the 3D globe. Pages: IDENT, POS INIT, RTE, DEP/ARR, LEGS, PROG, PERF INIT, TAKEOFF REF, APPROACH REF, THRUST LIM, VNAV, FIX, MENU and a PUSHBACK page that drives the "GeoFS Y Pushback Planner" script.
// @match        https://*.geo-fs.com/*
// @match        https://geo-fs.com/*
// @grant        none
// @run-at       document-idle
// ==/UserScript==

